---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="DistLLM website privacy policy."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="container-site max-w-3xl py-14">
    <h1 class="text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-faint">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    <div class="prose-doc mt-8">
      <p>This website stores no personal data and sets no tracking cookies of its own. Aggregate, anonymous usage analytics are collected via Plausible Analytics (EU-hosted), which does not use cookies or fingerprinting.</p>
      <p>The DistLLM software itself runs entirely on your own hardware. The project's developers receive no telemetry, logs, or model data from your deployments.</p>
      <p>Questions about this policy may be raised via GitHub issues.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
